    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Threatening to fill a bathtub with water and throw a toaster inside of it, you reluctantly agreed to run away from home with your half-sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996120/extras/a0b45e7fd78b3ce835208b2e39727245.avif?t=1745615651\" width=624 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Half-sister by technical definition, full-time enabler by choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996120/extras/6ffd61d54411bccb564477db647e0fbe.avif?t=1745615651\" width=624 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learned early that people discard what they no longer want, and to never forgive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996120/extras/2ecc9d3c588f07839ff0e6d5d5feaf09.avif?t=1745615651\" width=624 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kindness seeps away from a human as quickly as a fist lands on your face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996120/extras/4311a41d12b3d8b46dd191679641e6e4.avif?t=1745615651\" width=624 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to navigate all these human emotions, or will everything inevitably go to shit, as it always seems to do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No common route, every choice leads to a unique adventure. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings with dozens of meaningful choices and high replayability. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story of family dysfunction and understanding of love. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Messed up characters, each with their unique brand of trauma and secrets.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Threatening to fill a bathtub with water and throw a toaster inside of it, you reluctantly agreed to run away from home with your half-sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996120/extras/a0b45e7fd78b3ce835208b2e39727245.avif?t=1745615651\" width=624 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Half-sister by technical definition, full-time enabler by choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996120/extras/6ffd61d54411bccb564477db647e0fbe.avif?t=1745615651\" width=624 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learned early that people discard what they no longer want, and to never forgive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996120/extras/2ecc9d3c588f07839ff0e6d5d5feaf09.avif?t=1745615651\" width=624 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kindness seeps away from a human as quickly as a fist lands on your face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996120/extras/4311a41d12b3d8b46dd191679641e6e4.avif?t=1745615651\" width=624 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to navigate all these human emotions, or will everything inevitably go to shit, as it always seems to do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No common route, every choice leads to a unique adventure. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings with dozens of meaningful choices and high replayability. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story of family dysfunction and understanding of love. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Messed up characters, each with their unique brand of trauma and secrets.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Are We in Love?&quot; is a dark, choice-driven visual novel that questions love and family. There are no butterflies in your stomach, only the harsh reality of a chemical sting in your nostrils and the acrid aftertaste of vodka. No common route. Fully branched story.",
